{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adascripting\/gettingstartedwithadascript"]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"AdaEngine provides two ways to install Ada Script plugins:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Automatic discovery"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" embeds every ","type":"text"},{"code":".ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" file in an executable target at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"build time and generates one plugin backed by one target-level script module.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Manual loading"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" creates an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin","type":"reference"},{"text":" from source text or a file URL at runtime.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"AdaEditor-created projects use automatic discovery. Use manual loading when scripts live outside the Swift target, come from a downloaded package, or need explicit error handling."}]},{"anchor":"Create-a-script","level":2,"text":"Create a script","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Movement.ada"},{"type":"text","text":" anywhere below the executable target’s source directory, for example:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"text","code":["Sources\/MyGame\/","├── main.swift","└── Scripts\/","    └── Movement.ada"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Declare a system and its query with annotations:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"ada","code":["@system(scheduler: \"update\")","class MovementSystem {","    @query(Transform)","    var transforms;","","    func update(context) {","        for (var entity in transforms) {","            var position = entity.transform.position;","            position[0] += 100 * context.deltaTime;","            entity.transform.position = position;","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"AdaEngine discovers "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@system"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@query"},{"type":"text","text":" metadata and calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"update(context)"},{"type":"text","text":" whenever the selected scheduler runs."}]},{"anchor":"Enable-automatic-discovery","level":2,"text":"Enable automatic discovery","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Expose "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdaScriptBuildPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":" to your executable target in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ swift-tools-version: 6.2","import PackageDescription","","let package = Package(","    name: \"MyGame\",","    platforms: [","        .macOS(.v15)","    ],","    dependencies: [","        .package(","            url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/AdaEngine\/AdaEngine.git\",","            branch: \"main\"","        )","    ],","    targets: [","        .executableTarget(","            name: \"MyGame\",","            dependencies: [","                .product(name: \"AdaEngine\", package: \"AdaEngine\")","            ],","            plugins: [","                .plugin(name: \"AdaScriptBuildPlugin\", package: \"AdaEngine\")","            ]","        )","    ]",")"]},{"name":"Important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Choose a version requirement appropriate for your project instead of a branch dependency when consuming a released AdaEngine version."}]}],"type":"aside","style":"important"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The build plugin finds "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ada"},{"type":"text","text":" files through SwiftPM, sorts them by target-relative"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"path, and generates "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdaScriptPluginsGenerated.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" in the plugin work"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"directory. The generated plugin passes one source map to one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Script source is embedded in the executable; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"original files are not read at runtime."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Install the generated plugin in your app scene:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import AdaEngine","","@main","struct MyGame: App {","    var body: some AppScene {","        WindowGroup {","            GameView()","        }","        .addPlugins(AdaScriptPluginsGenerated())","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rebuilding the target after adding, removing, renaming, or editing an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ada"},{"type":"text","text":" file refreshes the generated source."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The same generated source contains native backing structs and registration for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scalar "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@component"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@resource"},{"type":"text","text":" declarations. Because these declarations"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change Swift layout, adding or editing their stored fields requires rebuilding"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the target rather than source-only reload."}]},{"anchor":"Register-custom-components","level":2,"text":"Register custom components","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ada Script resolves component names while plugins are set up. Register custom Swift components before the generated script plugin:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import AdaEngine","","@Component","struct Movement: Codable, Sendable {","    var velocity: Vector2","}","","struct GameComponentsPlugin: Plugin {","    @MainActor","    func setup(in app: borrowing AppWorlds) {","        Movement.registerComponent()","    }","}","","@main","struct MyGame: App {","    var body: some AppScene {","        WindowGroup {","            GameView()","        }","        .addPlugins(","            GameComponentsPlugin(),","            AdaScriptPluginsGenerated()","        )","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Component"},{"type":"text","text":" macro supplies field reflection for supported property types. A plain "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Component"},{"type":"text","text":" can participate in query matching, but its fields are not automatically available through the script bridge."}]},{"anchor":"Load-a-script-manually","level":2,"text":"Load a script manually","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when you need control over the source location or loading failure:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import AdaEngine","","struct RuntimeScriptsPlugin: Plugin {","    let scriptURL: URL","","    @MainActor","    func setup(in app: borrowing AppWorlds) {","        do {","            let script = try AdaScriptPlugin(contentsOf: scriptURL)","            app.addPlugin(script)","        } catch {","            print(\"Could not load Ada Script: \\(error)\")","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can also use "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin\/init(source:name:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when one source is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already in memory, or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdaScriptPlugin\/init(sources:name:)"},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptSource","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" values for a multi-file module. Script compilation,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"import resolution, and annotation validation happen during initialization."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Native component resolution happens later during plugin setup."}]},{"anchor":"Next-steps","level":2,"text":"Next steps","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Read "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLanguage","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for annotation syntax, then "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptECS","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for queries, component fields, and native iterator behavior."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptBasics","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLanguage","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptAnnotations","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLibraries"],"anchor":"Essentials","generated":true,"title":"Essentials"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ada"},{"type":"text","text":" file to an AdaEngine executable and run its systems without manually loading each script."}],"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Getting Started with Ada Script","modules":[{"name":"Ada Script"}]},"kind":"article","references":{"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptSource":{"url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptsource","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptSource","kind":"symbol","title":"AdaScriptSource","fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AdaScriptSource","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AdaScriptSource","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One source file embedded in an Ada Script module."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting":{"url":"\/documentation\/adascripting","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting","kind":"symbol","title":"Ada Script","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Write gameplay systems in Ada Script while keeping entity filtering and access planning in AdaEngine’s native ECS."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptLanguage":{"title":"Ada Script Language","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptlanguage","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLanguage","abstract":[{"text":"Use Ada Script syntax with AdaEngine declaration annotations. New to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"language? Start with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptBasics","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for values, functions, types,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"properties, control flow, asynchronous work, and annotations.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/GettingStartedWithAdaScript":{"title":"Getting Started with Ada Script","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/gettingstartedwithadascript","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript","abstract":[{"text":"Add an ","type":"text"},{"code":".ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" file to an AdaEngine executable and run its systems without manually loading each script.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptLibraries":{"title":"AdaScript Libraries","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptlibraries","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLibraries","abstract":[{"text":"Share reusable AdaScript functions, systems, and scriptable objects through a GitHub repository.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"AdaEditor installs the library and its transitive dependencies into the project. Run, Play Mode,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Preview, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"AdaScriptBuildPlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" load the same installed sources without network access.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptPlugin/init(source:name:)":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"convenience","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"source","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"name","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin\/init(source:name:)","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptplugin\/init(source:name:)","title":"init(source:name:)"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptBasics":{"title":"Ada Script Basics","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptbasics","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptBasics","abstract":[{"text":"Learn the syntax of Ada Script before connecting a script to a scene or ECS","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"world. Ada Script files use the ","type":"text"},{"code":".ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" extension. The examples on this page are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"small pieces you can combine in one file; a game does not need a ","type":"text"},{"code":"main()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"function. Start with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" to run a complete system.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptAnnotations":{"role":"article","type":"topic","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptAnnotations","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Choose an annotation by the declaration it describes. Annotation arguments"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are literals, identifiers, or lists of those values, not runtime expressions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The same spelling can have different roles: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@component"},{"type":"text","text":" declares a struct,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"while "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@component(required: true)"},{"type":"text","text":" binds an existing component to a scriptable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instance."}],"title":"Ada Script Annotation Reference","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptannotations"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptPlugin":{"url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptplugin","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin","kind":"symbol","title":"AdaScriptPlugin","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AdaScriptPlugin","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AdaScriptPlugin","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Loads an annotation-driven Ada Script module.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptECS":{"title":"Ada Script ECS","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptecs","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptECS","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Declare annotation-driven systems and iterate native AdaECS component columns."}],"kind":"article"}}}